							<v8:lang>en</v8:lang>
							<v8:content>   2. Mutual settlements state as of [ReconciliationPeriodEnd] according to [CounterpartyName_]</v8:content>
						</v8:item>
						<v8:item>
							<v8:lang>fa</v8:lang>
